# ==== Dependencias / build ====
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/out-tsc/
**/.angular/
**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# ==== Vercel / entornos ====
**/.vercel/
**/.env
**/.env.*
# EXCEPCIÓN: las plantillas .env.example (sin secretos reales) sí se versionan.
!**/.env.example

# ==== SO / editor ====
**/.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*

